{"nodes": [{"id": "phase_9_5_visual_canvas_blueprint_canvas_page", "label": "BlueprintCanvasPage", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/phase-9.5-visual-canvas.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "phase_9_5_visual_canvas_xyflow_react", "label": "@xyflow/react (React Flow)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/phase-9.5-visual-canvas.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "phase_9_5_visual_canvas_xyflow_adoption_rationale", "label": "React Flow adoption rationale", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/phase-9.5-visual-canvas.md", "source_location": "Locked decision 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "First new frontend dependency added in the project's history; justified because hand-rolling drag physics, edge routing, and zoom/pan would be a multi-week sink better solved by an existing library. Node layout stays simple \u2014 the library is for interaction, not auto-layout."}, {"id": "phase_9_5_visual_canvas_no_code_mandate", "label": "No-code mandate (no JSON textarea)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/phase-9.5-visual-canvas.md", "source_location": "Locked decision 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every StageDef field gets real form/picker UI so non-programmers can author a full blueprint graph with no JSON authoring surface anywhere in the product; sole carve-out is a script check's code field, which is inherently code."}, {"id": "phase_9_5_visual_canvas_ref_to_visual_mapping", "label": "Ref \u2192 visual element mapping", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/phase-9.5-visual-canvas.md", "source_location": "Locked decision 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "phase_9_5_visual_canvas_fixed_trunk_layout", "label": "Fixed sequential trunk layout, no auto-layout", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/phase-9.5-visual-canvas.md", "source_location": "Locked decision 5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Because stages execute in one fixed sequential order (nothing runs in parallel), node x-position is always the array index rather than a persisted/draggable coordinate; only memory edges need arc routing, avoiding a generic dagre/elkjs DAG layout engine."}, {"id": "phase_9_5_visual_canvas_memory_writer_lookup", "label": "Client-side memory-writer lookup", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/phase-9.5-visual-canvas.md", "source_location": "Locked decision 6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Scanning each stage's writes map client-side is ~10 lines and needed only for drawing edges; binding validity itself stays exclusively server-authoritative via POST /blueprints/:id/validate, never re-decided client-side."}, {"id": "phase_9_5_visual_canvas_parse_validation_path", "label": "parseValidationPath() utility", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/phase-9.5-visual-canvas.md", "source_location": "Locked decision 8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "phase_9_5_visual_canvas_post_blueprints_endpoint", "label": "POST /blueprints (create bare blueprint)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/phase-9.5-visual-canvas.md", "source_location": "Locked decision 7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "phase_9_5_visual_canvas_ensure_blueprint", "label": "BlueprintService.ensureBlueprint", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/phase-9.5-visual-canvas.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [